node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
docs
*.md

# Secrets never enter the build context. Nothing in the Dockerfiles copies an
# env file, but a stray `.env` in the tree would otherwise be readable to any
# `COPY . .` a future edit introduces — exclude them here and keep only the
# committed *.example templates.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.example

# Test code and local backups are not runtime artefacts — keep them out of the
# image so it ships less surface and no fixture data.
**/test/
**/*.test.ts
backups/
